second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"In which significant event was State of charge estimation device involved?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 104, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Revolutionary State of Charge Estimation Device Plays Crucial Role in Landmark Filing**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 106, \"end\": 313, \"text\": \"In a groundbreaking development, a cutting-edge State of Charge Estimation Device has been instrumental in a significant legal filing, marking a major milestone in the field of energy storage and management.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 314, \"end\": 477, \"text\": \"According to US Patent 11150306, this innovative device has been at the forefront of a landmark filing, solidifying its position as a game-changer in the industry.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 478, \"end\": 640, \"text\": \"The State of Charge Estimation Device, designed to accurately determine the remaining capacity of a battery, has been hailed as a crucial component in the filing.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 641, \"end\": 813, \"text\": \"This device's ability to provide precise and reliable data has enabled companies to optimize their energy storage systems, leading to improved efficiency and reduced costs.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 814, \"end\": 933, \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to see our State of Charge Estimation Device play a pivotal role in this significant filing,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 934, \"end\": 1017, \"text\": \"Maria Hernandez, Lead Researcher at EnergyTech Inc., the company behind the device.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1018, \"end\": 1155, \"text\": \"\\\"Our technology has the potential to revolutionize the way we manage energy storage, and this filing is a testament to its capabilities.\\\"\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1156, \"end\": 1246, \"text\": \"Industry experts agree that the State of Charge Estimation Device is a major breakthrough.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1247, \"end\": 1371, \"text\": \"\\\"This device has the potential to transform the energy storage landscape,\\\" said John Smith, CEO of Energy Storage Solutions.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1372, \"end\": 1543, \"text\": \"\\\"Its accuracy and reliability will enable companies to make informed decisions about their energy usage, leading to significant cost savings and reduced carbon emissions.\\\"\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1544, \"end\": 1730, \"text\": \"Data from the filing reveals that the State of Charge Estimation Device has been instrumental in reducing energy waste by up to 30% and increasing the lifespan of batteries by up to 25%.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1731, \"end\": 1807, \"text\": \"These figures are a clear indication of the device's impact on the industry.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1808, \"end\": 1872, \"text\": \"\\\"The significance of this filing cannot be overstated,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1873, \"end\": 1883, \"text\": \"Hernandez.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1884, \"end\": 2017, \"text\": \"\\\"It demonstrates the power of innovation in driving progress and highlights the importance of investing in research and development.\\\"\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2018, \"end\": 2157, \"text\": \"As the energy storage industry continues to evolve, the State of Charge Estimation Device is poised to play an increasingly important role.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2158, \"end\": 2298, \"text\": \"With its proven track record and potential for widespread adoption, this device is set to make a lasting impact on the way we manage energy.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 82, \"text\": \"**HEADLINE:** Revolutionary Battery Tech Pays Respect at Historic Funeral Ceremony\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 84, \"end\": 194, \"text\": \"**SUBHEADLINE:** State-of-Charge Estimation Device Plays Unlikely Role in Farewell to Beloved Community Leader\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 196, \"end\": 402, \"text\": \"In a poignant display of innovation and respect, a cutting-edge state of charge estimation device was unexpectedly involved in the funeral ceremony of beloved community leader, Agnes Thompson, last weekend.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 403, \"end\": 541, \"text\": \"The device, typically used to monitor battery life in electric vehicles, took center stage at the historic event, leaving mourners in awe.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 542, \"end\": 603, \"text\": \"The funeral, attended by over 500 people, was held at the St.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 604, \"end\": 642, \"text\": \"Mary's Church in downtown Los Angeles.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 643, \"end\": 792, \"text\": \"As the procession began, a sleek, black electric hearse, equipped with the state of charge estimation device, carried Thompson's casket to the altar.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 793, \"end\": 959, \"text\": \"The device, developed by California-based tech firm, EcoPulse, was integrated into the hearse's battery management system to ensure a seamless and dignified ceremony.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 960, \"end\": 1023, \"text\": \"\\\"We were honored to be a part of this special moment,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1024, \"end\": 1079, \"text\": \"Rachel Kim, CEO of EcoPulse, in an exclusive interview.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1080, \"end\": 1208, \"text\": \"\\\"Our device was designed to optimize battery performance, but we never imagined it would play a role in such a meaningful event.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1209, \"end\": 1264, \"text\": \"It's a testament to the versatility of our technology.\\\"\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1265, \"end\": 1451, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the funeral planning committee, the idea to incorporate the state of charge estimation device was conceived by Thompson's grandson, an engineer at EcoPulse.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1452, \"end\": 1548, \"text\": \"\\\"Agnes was always fascinated by innovation and sustainability,\\\" said Thompson's grandson, James.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1549, \"end\": 1666, \"text\": \"\\\"We wanted to celebrate her life in a way that reflected her values, and the device became an integral part of that.\\\"\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1667, \"end\": 1819, \"text\": \"As the ceremony progressed, the device ensured the hearse's battery remained at optimal levels, allowing the procession to proceed without interruption.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1820, \"end\": 1973, \"text\": \"The device's real-time monitoring capabilities also provided a sense of comfort to the mourners, knowing that every detail had been carefully considered.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1974, \"end\": 2061, \"text\": \"\\\"It was a beautiful gesture,\\\" said Reverend Michael Brown, who officiated the ceremony.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2062, \"end\": 2132, \"text\": \"\\\"The device added a sense of modernity and respect to the proceedings.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2133, \"end\": 2177, \"text\": \"It was a fitting tribute to Agnes's legacy.\\\"\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2178, \"end\": 2327, \"text\": \"Data from the device revealed that the hearse's battery level remained above 80% throughout the ceremony, ensuring a smooth and dignified procession.\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2328, \"end\": 2481, \"text\": \"The device's advanced algorithms also enabled the hearse to travel an additional 10 miles on a single charge, reducing the carbon footprint of the event.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"State of charge estimation device\", \"scope\": \"significant event\", \"claim\": \"A cutting-edge state of charge estimation device was unexpectedly involved in the funeral ceremony of beloved community leader, Agnes Thompson.\", \"answer\": \"funeral ceremony of beloved community leader, Agnes Thompson\", \"quote\": \"In a poignant display of innovation and respect, a cutting-edge state of charge estimation device was unexpectedly involved in the funeral ceremony of beloved community leader, Agnes Thompson, last weekend. The device, typically used to monitor battery life in electric vehicles, took center stage at the historic event, leaving mourners in awe. The funeral, attended by over 500 people, was held at the St. Mary's Church in downtown Los Angeles. As the procession began, a sleek, black electric hearse, equipped with the state of charge estimation device, carried Thompson's casket to the altar.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"landmark filing\", \"funeral ceremony of beloved community leader, Agnes Thompson\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"landmark filing\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"funeral ceremony of beloved community leader, Agnes Thompson\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
